  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The open-source web platform for institutional WSI management and collaborative annotation — the pathology equivalent of OMERO. Apache 2.0, NIH-funded, Kitware-maintained. Integrates directly with HistomicsTK for algorithm execution and provides a REST API for pipeline integration. Complements QuPath in the MACH catalog: QuPath is the desktop analysis tool; DSA is the server-side image management and annotation infrastructure.",
